# Compiled binaries in module directories
# Ignore everything in exercises/ and solutions/ then un-ignore source files
**/exercises/*
!**/exercises/*.c
!**/exercises/*.h
!**/exercises/*.sh
!**/exercises/*.py
!**/exercises/*.txt
!**/exercises/Makefile
**/solutions/*
!**/solutions/*.c
!**/solutions/*.h
!**/solutions/*.sh
!**/solutions/*.py
!**/solutions/*.txt
!**/solutions/Makefile
**/sol-*

# Exercise binaries built to module root (extensionless ELF files)
# Each module's Makefile compiles exercises like: gcc -o linked_list exercises/linked_list.c
# These land in the module directory without a prefix or extension.
